message: "If you use this software, please cite the paper below."
type: software
title: "TUMPhotonicRouter"
abstract: >-
  A grid-based photonic waveguide router for gdsfactory schematics: A* search
  with straight, 45-degree and 90-degree primitives of a fixed bend radius,
  legal waveguide crossings, negotiated rip-up and reroute, pre-placed
  crossing grids, path-length matching with meanders, and heater electrical
  routing. Rust core, Python flow.
